# ssrf.allow — explicit egress exceptions for the private-range guard
# (finding 29).
#
# The swap proxy resolves every request host and refuses private ranges
# (RFC 1918, loopback, link-local, CGNAT/tailnet space) by DEFAULT.
# A fresh install ships this file empty: default deny.
#
# Lines are hostnames (exact, or leading-dot for subdomains) or CIDR
# literals. Blank lines and #-comments are ignored.
#
# This box allows the tailnet (the agent's own infrastructure), added at
# deploy time:
#   100.64.0.0/10
